{"reviews":[{"id":"B09B47FBLB-0","r":4.0,"t":"Stuck well to skin and made well looks awesome!","x":"Stuck well to face. Didn\u2019t leave residue. Worked and looked nice. Good buy. Please hit the helpful button if you found this review useful so I\u2019ll know to leave more","h":101,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-1","r":4.0,"t":"Good quality gems...","x":"The gems are a good quality, but we\u2019re larger than what I needed.  I haven\u2019t used them yet for that reason.  I was looking for gems to use as a faux nose piercing.  Will keep them on standby for another project.","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-2","r":5.0,"t":"These stayed place for the whole duration of the music ...","x":"These stayed place for the whole duration of the music festival I went to with the help of some eyelash glue. One I put on without the glue and it fell off, but it was after a while of dancing and maybe a little rain so I still think these deserve five stars.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-3","r":5.0,"t":"super cute for pride!","x":"i wore these little face gems to pride clt and i LOVED the look! i just applied some eyelash glue and stuck it onto my face and it lasted the whole day! i don\u2019t think it would have held on without the eyelash glue though. i was wearing a full face of makeup and it was also very hot that day some i\u2019m surpised it stayed on my face. will definitely reuse these one day!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great item","x":"I wore these on a vacation trip and they were awesome. I received a lot of compliments and they stayed on until I removed them.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-5","r":5.0,"t":"They make you look good!","x":"I did not wear that many, I had 2 over each eye and two on my upper arm where my dress split, they never came off, they were very easy to apply, and easy to reapply, I didn't want to move them too much... but they stuck anyway, until the end of the night. They stuck to a lot of make up foundation and powder! Easy to remove! I just had a ball with these and they look great! They give you just the right amount of jazz!!!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-6","r":5.0,"t":"I had placed the stickers on my cheek bones and ...","x":"I had placed the stickers on my cheek bones and they stayed on for 10 hours! They probably would have stayed on longer but I had taken them off to go to bed. At one point I was even out in the rain and they were strong enough to not fall off. I am going to order these for my sister.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-7","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty but the adhesive doesn't stick on skin","x":"I did my sister's makeup for night out with the cousins. It looked really nice on her. However, I had to use eyelash glue to get it to stick on her skin. I wasted 2 stickers since it fell off somewhere.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-8","r":1.0,"t":"Too expensive, poor quality","x":"The adhesive comes off too easily while trying to peel the gems from the paper. Too expensive so how cheap the quality is. Does not stay on with just the sticky stuff on back. I had to use my own glue","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great Adhesive","x":"Stayed on the entire day and night....great adhesive would purchase again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-10","r":5.0,"t":"Rainbooowwwww","x":"Nothing beats a full package of rainbow jewels! I love these. I use eyelash glue to stick my jewels on my face and I've been able to reuse almost all of these multiple times. Buy theses and transform your beautiful face into a beautiful RAINBOW FACE!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-11","r":5.0,"t":"I Love These Little Face Gems","x":"I Love These Little Face Gems. They Stick Really Well And Can Be Used A Couple Times Over. I Love The Fact That You Can Still Have The Beauty Of These Gems Without All Of The Hassel And Pain Of A Actual Peircing. Will Buy Again.  \u2764\u2764\u2764","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-12","r":2.0,"t":"POOR QUALITY","x":"Don't agree with the price because you don't get many gems and they don't stick for very long. They were constantly falling off everywhere.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-13","r":5.0,"t":"High quality perfect for festival.","x":"High quality product. Used eyelash glue to secure to face and came off easy after festival. Impressed with the quality. Will buy again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-14","r":4.0,"t":"Super cute","x":"They don't stay on without glue, but they are cute and I expected that. My daughter loved them and they worked for what we needed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-15","r":5.0,"t":"Use with adhesive glue for best results","x":"I used these to glue on crystals to stick around my eyes for a different look. They worked really well and topped my eye look.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-16","r":4.0,"t":"Great!","x":"I used these for a fairy Halloween look and they looked so good! You do need to use an adhesive so they stay.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-17","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty good.","x":"As pictured. I don't know how well they stick on their own because I used clear lash glue to secure them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-18","r":5.0,"t":"Worked great, loved all the sparkle","x":"Used this for part of my mermaid costume with chunky glitter.  Worked great, loved all the sparkle.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-19","r":1.0,"t":"Leaves scars","x":"Horrible- Leaves scars apparently- hopefully they will go away or I\u2019m going to sue! Don\u2019t buy!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for Pride, stuck surprisingly well","x":"Didn't even use eyelash glue and these stayed on all day long. Will definitely buy again!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-21","r":5.0,"t":"cute!","x":"came in one day, good quality very sparkly, just need some eyelash or face glue to apply","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-22","r":5.0,"t":"but looked wonderful and stayed on well","x":"Required extra glue (used eyelash adhesive), but looked wonderful and stayed on well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-23","r":4.0,"t":"Overall...good product","x":"Perfect for halloween. Some stickies lose their \u201cstick\u201d and fall off. But very few.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B09B47FBLB-24","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Not a lot of stones, but they stay on perfectly. Wore these for the whole day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the gems stay on well and last a long time, especially when applied with eyelash glue.","cites":[1,3,4,5,6,7,10,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the gems do not stick well with their own adhesive and require extra glue like eyelash glue.","cites":[3,4,8,9,15]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the gems as cute, pretty, and good-looking.","cites":[1,4,5,6,8,11,12,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the quality and reusability of the gems.","cites":[2,11,12,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain about poor quality and the product being too expensive for what you get.","cites":[9,13]}]},"qa":[]}